†US Academic & Government Discount Requests】\nL103:     * 【35†FAQs†utex.freshdesk.com】\nL104:     * 【36†Order Status】\nL105:     * 【37†Contact UTEX】\nL106: \nL107:   * 【32†Request A Quote】\nL108:   * 【38†FAQs†utex.freshdesk.com】\nL109: # DAS Vitamin Cocktail\nL110: \nL111: #### Directions\nL112: #### For 100 mL Total\nL113:   1. To approximately 85 mL of dH_{2}O add Tricine while stirring continuously.\nL114:   2. Adjust the pH to 8.0.\nL115:   3. Add each of the remaining components in the order listed.\nL116:   4. Bring total volume to 100 mL with dH_{2}O.\nL117:   5. Sterilize the vitamin cocktail by filtration through a 0.45 µm Millipore filter.\nL118:   6. Store in the dark at freezer temperature.\nL119: #  | Component  | Amount  | Stock Solution Concentration  | Final Concentration in DAS\nL120: --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nL121: 1  | Tricine\nL122: (adjust to pH 8)\nL123: (Sigma T 5816-256)  | 0.9 g/100 mL  |  |\nL124: 2  | Thiamine\nL125: (Sigma T 1270)  | 0.067 g/100 mL  | 2.0 mM  | 0.99 µM\nL126: 3  | Biotin\nL127: (Sigma B 4639)  | 0.001 g/100 mL  | 0.041 mM  | 0.02 µM\nL128: 4  | Vitamin B_{12}\nL129: (add after autoclaving)\nL130: (Sigma V 6629)  | 0.0008 g/100 mL  | 0.0059 mM  | 0.0029 µM\nL131: 5  | Pantothenate\nL132: (Sigma P 2250)  | 0.002 g/100 mL  | 0.091 mM  | 0.046 µM\nL133: 6  | PABA\nL134: (p-aminobenzoic acid)\nL135: (Sigma A 1174)  | 0.004 g/100 mL  | 0.291 mM  | 0.15 µM\nL136: ### Follow UTEX\nL137: \nL138: Sign up for our newsletter to stay informed on any new products, services, and educational opportunities!\nL139: \nL140: [Input][Input] [Input]\nL141: \nL142: [Input] [Input: Please enter your email address...] [Input]\nL143: \nL144: * * *\nL145: \nL146:   * 【2†PRODUCTS】\nL147:   * 【41†Living Algal Strains】\nL148:   * 【4†Algae Express】\nL149:   * 【6†Algal Culture Media】\nL150:   * 【10†Bulk Volume Microalgae】\nL151:   * 【9†Teaching Kits】\nL152:   * 【11†UTEX Photobioreactor Packages】\nL153:   * 【12†RGB-LED Lighting Platform】\nL154:   * 【4